{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://opentine.com/schemas/tine-cli-ingest-1.schema.json",
  "title": "tine ingest ... --json",
  "description": "Batched streaming ingest. `ingest policy` signs and holds a sampling policy; `ingest --batch` samples, signs and chains one batch; `ingest verify` checks the chain, counts and policy; `ingest packs` re-reads a tine serve pack store; `ingest seal`, `audit`, `prove` and `segments` seal Merkle-rooted episode segments and audit them by sampling (0.84).",
